      "updated": 1788266716457,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "character\nwill contain the sub folder for each \ncharacter present \n\nThere will be following apis\nfirst to get details about character \nex get request character/character_name\nwe should get a json file where all parrent and \nsub json are combined  \n\n\n    Need to create a mapper for that\n\nSecond api to create a new character that will have \nsame parrent and sun json files stored user needs to \npass all the data for json or else they will be empty \n\nthird api to update the stats of existing character ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "character\nwill contain the sub folder for each \ncharacter present \n\nThere will be following apis\nfirst to get details about character \nex get request character/character_name\nwe should get a json file where all parrent and \nsub json are combined  \n\n\n    Need to create a mapper for that\n\nSecond api to create a new character that will have \nsame parrent and sun json files stored user needs to \npass all the data for json or else they will be empty \n\nthird api to update the stats of existing character ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
